---
import Breadcrumbs from '@/components/Breadcrumbs.astro'
import PageHead from '@/components/PageHead.astro'
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout class="max-w-3xl">
  <PageHead slot="head" title="Privacy Policy" />
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Privacy Policy', icon: 'lucide:shield' }]} />

  <section class="prose max-w-none">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">Last updated: May 4, 2026</p>

    <p>
      This Privacy Policy explains how Nowispow, Inc ("Nowispow", "we", "us", or "our") collects,
      uses, and stores information when you visit kapisce.com (the "Site"). We are committed to
      privacy by design: we self-host all analytics and email infrastructure, and we do not sell
      your personal data.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

    <h3>Information you provide</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Email address and role</strong> — when you subscribe to updates via our sign-up
        form. Role (educator / book-club leader / reader) and group size are optional.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Contact form submissions</strong> — name, email, subject, and message when you
        contact us via the contact page.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Purchase information</strong> — handled directly by Lemon Squeezy (our payment
        processor). We receive only a purchase confirmation and the email address needed to
        deliver your license key. We do not store payment card details.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Analytics events</strong> — page views, chapter engagement, and sign-up funnel
        events are collected by our self-hosted PostHog instance at analytics.kapisce.com.
        PostHog collects a hashed or anonymised device identifier, browser type, approximate
        geographic region (country/region level), and the events listed above. No cross-site
        tracking. IP addresses are not stored in full.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Server logs</strong> — our hosting infrastructure (Dokploy) retains standard
        access logs (IP address, timestamp, URL, HTTP status) for up to 30 days for security
        and debugging purposes.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To send you the updates or newsletters you subscribed to (via Listmonk).</li>
      <li>To deliver your license key and support your purchase.</li>
      <li>To understand how readers engage with content so we can improve the Site.</li>
      <li>To respond to contact form inquiries.</li>
      <li>To maintain the security and integrity of the Site.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Data Processors</h2>
    <p>We use the following third-party services that may process your data:</p>

    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Processor</th>
          <th>Purpose</th>
          <th>Data shared</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>PostHog</strong> (self-hosted)</td>
          <td>Site analytics</td>
          <td>Anonymised usage events, approximate location</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Listmonk</strong> (self-hosted)</td>
          <td>Email list management</td>
          <td>Email address, role, group size</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Resend</strong></td>
          <td>Transactional email relay</td>
          <td>Recipient email address, email content</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Lemon Squeezy</strong></td>
          <td>Payment processing (Merchant of Record)</td>
          <td>Email address, purchase details</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <p>
      PostHog and Listmonk are self-hosted on our own infrastructure — your data does not leave
      our servers for analytics or email list purposes.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Cookies and Local Storage</h2>
    <p>
      The Site uses browser local storage to store your reading preferences (theme, speed-reader
      settings) and, if you have purchased an enhanced edition, your license key. No third-party
      advertising cookies are used.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Email subscriber records are retained until you unsubscribe.</li>
      <li>Analytics event data is retained for 12 months, then aggregated or deleted.</li>
      <li>Server access logs are retained for 30 days.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>
      You may unsubscribe from our mailing list at any time using the link in any email we send.
      To request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data, contact us at
      <a href="mailto:webmaster@nowispow.com">webmaster@nowispow.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      The Site is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal
      information from children under 13. If you believe we have inadvertently collected such
      information, please contact us so we can delete it.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will post the updated policy on
      this page with a revised "Last updated" date.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For privacy-related questions, contact us at
      <a href="mailto:webmaster@nowispow.com">webmaster@nowispow.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
